        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, lorry 28t, rape methyl ester 100%</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, lorry 28t, rape methyl ester 100%
Average data for the  operation of heavy duty vehicles (20-28t) in Switzerland, with an average load of  50%.;
Synonyms: RME; 
UUID: bc6050e2-e0a1-347e-8b93-3f71884a68a7
rape methyl ester, at regional storage supplies is included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Heavy metal emissions to water and to soil are included. Tyre abrasion is included.
Location: Data refers to average transport conditions in Switzerland.
Technology: Euro3
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: National statistics, data from technical institutions and literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc6050e2-e0a1-347e-8b93-3f71884a68a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
